etaData\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import select\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Table\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.sql import FROM_LINTING\r\n\r\nmetadata = MetaData()\r\nmy_table = Table(\r\n    \"tbl\",\r\n    metadata,\r\n    Column(\"id\", Integer, primary_key=True),\r\n    Column(\"data\", JSON()),\r\n)\r\n\r\nsub_dict = my_table.c.data[\"d\"]\r\ntv = func.json_each(sub_dict).table_valued(\"key\")\r\nhas_key = tv.c.key == \"f\"\r\nstmt = select(my_table.c.id).where(has_key)\r\nprint(stmt.compile(linting=FROM_LINTING))\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nthe SQL is:\r\n\r\n```\r\nSELECT tbl.id \r\nFROM tbl, json_each(tbl.data[:data_1]) AS anon_1 \r\nWHERE anon_1.key = :key_1\r\n```\r\n\r\nand....that's not a cartesian product. so lets just take the whole \"table_valued\" world and remove it from linting:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/lib/sqlalchemy/sql/compiler.py b/lib/sqlalchemy/sql/compiler.py\r\nindex f8019b9c64..2d61b06419 100644\r\n--- a/lib/sqlalchemy/sql/compiler.py\r\n+++ b/lib/sqlalchemy/sql/compiler.py\r\n@@ -3173,6 +3173,7 @@ class SQLCompiler(Compiled):\r\n         return None\r\n \r\n     def visit_table_valued_alias(self, element, **kw):\r\n+        kw[\"from_linter\"] = None\r\n         if element._is_lateral:\r\n             return self.visit_lateral(element, **kw)\r\n         else:\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/